DESCRIPTION:Do you have questions on internal mobility? Join us as we hear from employees who have done internal mobility, hiring managers and releasing managers to debunk some of the myths you may have!\n\nSpeaker\n(1). Muhammad Levy Aninditio, Institutional Banking Group\n(2). Sulaiman, Group Strategy, Transformation, Analytics​ and Research\n(3). Andreas Agung HARYONO, Treasury & Markets\n(4). Sonja Kristianti, Consumer Banking Group\n\nModerator\n(1). Yafet Daniel Kristian, Group HR\n-~-~-~-~-~-~-~-~-~-~-~-~-~-~-~-~-~-~-~-~-~-~-\n\n\nJOIN WEBEX MEETING\nhttps://dbs.webex.com/dbs/j.php?MTID=m817ff38e99e3e8158634b19281b12b3c\nMeeting number (access code): 2511 576 8998\n\n\nMeeting password: 123!\n\n\n\nTAP TO JOIN FROM A MOBILE DEVICE (ATTENDEES ONLY)\n+65-3157-6442,,25115768998## tel:%2B65-3157-6442,,*01*25115768998%23%23*01* Singapore Toll\n\n\nJOIN BY PHONE\n+65-3157-6442 Singapore Toll\n\nGlobal call-in numbers\nhttps://dbs.webex.com/dbs/globalcallin.php?MTID=m40fe0c33f85275b5c4e3f97561b30408\n\n\nJOIN FROM A VIDEO SYSTEM OR APPLICATION\nDial sip:25115768998@dbs.webex.com\nYou can also dial 210.4.202.4 and enter your meeting number.\n\n\n\nIf you are a host, click here and login site to view host information:\nhttps://dbs.webex.com/webappng/sites/dbs/meeting/info/240438979d594a6f8e73fa41ca666797\n\n\n\nCan't join the meeting? Contact support here:\nhttps://dbs.webex.com/dbs/mc\n\n\nIMPORTANT NOTICE: Please note that this Webex service allows audio and other information sent during the session to be recorded, which may be discoverable in a legal matter. You should inform all meeting attendees prior to recording if you intend to record the meeting.\n
